<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#08080b">
<title>ASTROVYN — Converting Curiosity Into Innovations</title>
<meta name="description" content="ASTROVYN is an independent research and innovation community exploring space science, artificial intelligence, robotics, propulsion, quantum physics and future technology.">
<meta name="keywords" content="ASTROVYN, space science, innovation, AI, robotics, research, technology, astronomy">
<meta name="author" content="ASTROVYN">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
--bg: #08080b;
--bg2: #0d0d12;
--panel: #111117;
--panel2: #16161e;
--red: #e63946;
--red2: #ff5360;
--white: #f5f5f7;
--muted: #92929f;
--line: rgba(255,255,255,.09);
--glow: rgba(230,57,70,.2);
--mono: "DM Mono", monospace;
--heading: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
--body: "Inter", sans-serif;
}
* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior:smooth; scroll-padding-top:90px; }
body {
background:var(--bg);
color:var(--white);
font-family:var(--body);
line-height:1.7;
overflow-x:hidden;
}
body::before {
content:"";
position:fixed;
inset:0;
pointer-events:none;
z-index:50;
opacity:.12;
background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 180 180' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.9' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='.16'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
}
a { color:inherit; text-decoration:none; }
button, input, textarea { font:inherit; }
button { cursor:pointer; }
img, svg { max-width:100%; }
::selection { background:var(--red); color:white; }
.container { width:min(1180px, 90%); margin:auto; }
.section { padding:110px 0; position:relative; }
.section-head { max-width:720px; margin-bottom:52px; }
.eyebrow {
display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
font:11px var(--mono); letter-spacing:2.5px;
color:var(--red2); text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:18px;
}
.eyebrow::before { content:""; width:24px; height:1px; background:var(--red); }
h1,h2,h3,h4 { font-family:var(--heading); line-height:1.12; }
h2 { font-size:clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.8rem); letter-spacing:-2px; font-weight:600; }
.section-head p { color:var(--muted); margin-top:20px; max-width:650px; }
.accent { color:var(--red2); }
.muted { color:var(--muted); }
.small-label { font:10px var(--mono); letter-spacing:1.5px; color:var(--muted); text-transform:uppercase; }
.btn {
display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:10px;
border:1px solid transparent; padding:13px 20px;
font-size:12px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.3px;
transition:.3s; border-radius:3px;
}
.btn-primary { background:var(--red); color:white; }
.btn-primary:hover { background:#ff4c5a; transform:translateY(-3px); box-shadow:0 10px 35px var(--glow); }
.btn-outline { border-color:var(--line); background:rgba(255,255,255,.02); }
.btn-outline:hover { border-color:var(--red); color:var(--red2); transform:translateY(-3px); }
.text-link { color:var(--red2); font-size:12px; font-weight:700; }
.text-link span { display:inline-block; transition:.3s; }
.text-link:hover span { transform:translateX(5px); }
/* LOADER */
#loader {
position:fixed; inset:0; background:#07070a; z-index:2000;
display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
flex-direction:column; transition:opacity .8s, visibility .8s;
}
#loader.done { opacity:0; visibility:hidden; }
.loader-mark { font:700 clamp(30px,8vw,64px) var(--heading); letter-spacing:8px; }
.loader-mark span { color:var(--red); }
.loader-line { width:180px; height:2px; background:#292930; margin-top:25px; overflow:hidden; }
.loader-line::after { content:""; display:block; height:100%; width:40%; background:var(--red); animation:load 1.1s ease-in-out infinite; }
.loader-caption { margin-top:14px; color:var(--muted); font:10px var(--mono); letter-spacing:3px; }
@keyframes load { from {transform:translateX(-100%)} to {transform:translateX(350%)} }
/* NAVIGATION */
header {
height:76px; position:fixed; top:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:100;
border-bottom:1px solid transparent; transition:.3s;
}
header.scrolled { background:rgba(8,8,11,.9); backdrop-filter:blur(18px); border-color:var(--line); }
.nav { height:100%; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; }
.logo { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:11px; font:700 19px var(--heading); letter-spacing:2px; }
.logo-wordmark { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:0; min-width:150px; }
.logo-wordmark img { display:block; width:150px; height:27px; object-fit:cover; object-position:center; border-radius:2px; }
.logo-wordmark small { display:block; font:8px var(--mono); color:var(--muted); letter-spacing:2px; margin-top:3px; }
.logo-symbol {
width:34px; height:34px; display:grid; place-items:center;
border:1px solid var(--red); color:var(--red); font-size:19px;
transform:rotate(45deg);
}
.logo-symbol span { transform:rotate(-45deg); }
.logo small { display:block; font:8px var(--mono); color:var(--muted); letter-spacing:2px; margin-top:-2px; }
.nav-links { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:27px; }
.nav-links a { font-size:11px; color:#b9b9c3; transition:.25s; }
.nav-links a:hover { color:white; }
.nav-links .nav-cta { padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid rgba(230,57,70,.55); color:white; }
.menu-toggle { display:none; border:0; color:white; background:none; font-size:25px; }
/* HERO */
.hero {
min-height:100vh; padding:150px 0 90px; display:flex; align-items:center;
position:relative; overflow:hidden;
background:
radial-gradient(ellipse at 76% 42%, rgba(95,14,28,.2), transparent 42%),
linear-gradient(180deg,#09090d 0%,#08080b 100%);
}
.hero::before {
content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; pointer-events:none;
background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.025) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.025) 1px,transparent 1px);
background-size:65px 65px;
mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,black,transparent 90%);
}
.hero-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr; gap:35px; align-items:center; position:relative; z-index:2; }
.hero-copy { max-width:670px; }
.status { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; font:10px var(--mono); color:#c4c4ce; letter-spacing:1.5px; border:1px solid var(--line); padding:8px 12px; margin-bottom:28px; }
.status-dot { width:7px; height:7px; background:#65d6a0; border-radius:50%; box-shadow:0 0 12px #65d6a0; animation:pulse 2s infinite; }
@keyframes pulse { 50% { opacity:.35; box-shadow:0 0 2px #65d6a0; } }
.hero h1 { font-size:clamp(3.3rem,7.5vw,7rem); line-height:.95; letter-spacing:-5px; font-weight:700; }
.hero h1 .outline { color:transparent; -webkit-text-stroke:1px #f1f1f3; }
.hero h1 .red { color:var(--red); }
.hero-subtitle { font-size:clamp(14px,1.5vw,17px); color:#b3b3bf; margin-top:25px; max-width:480px; }
.hero-actions { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; margin-top:32px; }
.hero-meta { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:28px; margin-top:50px; }
.meta-item { border-left:1px solid var(--red); padding-left:12px; }
.meta-item strong { display:block; font:12px var(--mono); color:#eee; }
.meta-item span { font-size:10px; color:var(--muted); }
/* ORBIT ART */
.universe { position:relative; width:min(100%,520px); aspect-ratio:1; margin:auto; display:grid; place-items:center; }
.universe::before { content:""; position:absolute; width:82%; height:82%; border-radius:50%; background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(157,25,46,.17),transparent 68%); filter:blur(15px); }
.orbit { position:absolute; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15); border-radius:50%; transform:rotate(-27deg); }
.orbit.one { width:82%; height:33%; animation:orbitSpin 25s linear infinite; }
.orbit.two { width:94%; height:49%; transform:rotate(40deg); border-color:rgba(230,57,70,.35); animation:orbitSpin 35s linear infinite reverse; }
.orbit.three { width:68%; height:68%; transform:rotate(65deg); border-style:dashed; border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.09); animation:orbitSpin 70s linear infinite; }
@keyframes orbitSpin { to { transform:rotate(333deg); } }
.planet {
width:36%; aspect-ratio:1; border-radius:50%; position:relative; overflow:hidden;
background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%,#f5b0a0 0%,#c43e4b 20%,#66202e 48%,#160e19 76%);
box-shadow:inset -25px -20px 35px #030307, inset 8px 6px 15px rgba(255,255,255,.18),0 0 70px rgba(230,57,70,.22);
animation:planetFloat 6s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.planet::before {
content:""; position:absolute; inset:-20%; border-radius:50%;
background:repeating-linear-gradient(12deg,transparent 0 14px,rgba(10,8,15,.32) 15px 18px,transparent 19px 30px);
transform:rotate(-22deg);
}
.planet::after { content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; border-radius:50%; background:linear-gradient(115deg,transparent 20%,rgba(0,0,0,.12) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,.88) 95%); }
@keyframes planetFloat { 50% { transform:translateY(-13px); } }
.satellite { position:absolute; width:10px; height:10px; background:var(--red2); border-radius:50%; box-shadow:0 0 18px var(--red); top:18%; right:17%; }
.satellite::after { content:""; position:absolute; width:34px; height:1px; background:var(--red2); transform:rotate(-35deg); top:5px; right:5px; }
.star { position:absolute; width:3px; height:3px; background:white; border-radius:50%; box-shadow:0 0 10px white; animation:twinkle 3s infinite; }
.star.s1 { top:15%; left:24%; } .star.s2 { top:73%; left:14%; animation-delay:1s; }
.star.s3 { top:28%; right:9%; animation-delay:2s; } .star.s4 { bottom:15%; right:27%; }
@keyframes twinkle { 50% { opacity:.15; transform:scale(.6); } }
.orbit-label { position:absolute; font:9px var(--mono); letter-spacing:1px; color:#a2a2b0; }
.orbit-label.l1 { top:13%; left:4%; } .orbit-label.l2 { bottom:16%; left:1%; }
.orbit-label.l3 { bottom:10%; right:4%; }
/* MARQUEE */
.marquee { overflow:hidden; border-block:1px solid var(--line); padding:18px 0; background:#0b0b10; }
.marquee-track { display:flex; width:max-content; animation:marquee 35s linear infinite; }
.marquee-item { font:10px var(--mono); letter-spacing:2px; color:#c2c2cd; white-space:nowrap; padding:0 28px; }
.marquee-item span { color:var(--red); margin-right:20px; }
@keyframes marquee { to { transform:translateX(-50%); } }
/* ABOUT */
.about-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr; gap:70px; align-items:start; }
.about-visual {
min-height:410px; position:relative; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid var(--line);
background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%,rgba(230,57,70,.12),transparent 60%),#0d0d12;
display:grid; place-items:center;
}
.about-visual::before,.about-visual::after { content:""; position:absolute; border:1px solid rgba(230,57,70,.25); border-radius:50%; width:270px; height:270px; }
.about-visual::after { width:190px; height:190px; border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.12); }
.about-symbol { font:900 110px var(--heading); color:transparent; -webkit-text-stroke:1px var(--red); z-index:2; animation:aboutPulse 4s ease-in-out infinite; }
@keyframes aboutPulse { 50% { text-shadow:0 0 35px rgba(230,57,70,.35); transform:scale(1.04); } }
.visual-corner { position:absolute; font:9px var(--mono); color:var(--muted); letter-spacing:1px; }
.visual-corner.tl { top:18px; left:18px; } .visual-corner.br { bottom:18px; right:18px; }
.about-content h3 { font-size:clamp(25px,3vw,38px); font-weight:500; margin-bottom:22px; }
.about-content p { color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:16px; font-size:14px; }
.about-highlight { border-left:2px solid var(--red); padding:18px 22px; margin:28px 0; background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(230,57,70,.08),transparent); color:#ddd; font:500 16px var(--heading); }
/* MISSION */
.mission-section { background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0b0b10,#08080b); border-block:1px solid var(--line); }
.mission-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:1px; background:var(--line); border:1px solid var(--line); }
.mission-card { padding:32px 27px; background:#0c0c11; transition:.35s; }
.mission-card:hover { background:#141117; }
.card-index { color:var(--red); font:11px var(--mono); letter-spacing:2px; margin-bottom:35px; }
.mission-card h3 { font-size:22px; margin-bottom:14px; }
.mission-card p { font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); }
.mission-icon { color:var(--red2); font-size:23px; margin-bottom:18px; }
/* RESEARCH */
.research-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:16px; }
.research-card {
min-height:270px; padding:26px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--panel);
position:relative; overflow:hidden; transition:transform .35s,border-color .35s,background .35s;
}
.research-card::after { content:""; position:absolute; width:150px; height:150px; border:1px solid rgba(230,57,70,.1); border-radius:50%; right:-70px; bottom:-70px; transition:.4s; }
.research-card:hover { transform:translateY(-7px); border-color:rgba(230,57,70,.55); background:#131118; }
.research-card:hover::after { transform:scale(1.6); border-color:rgba(230,57,70,.25); }
.research-top { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:30px; }
.research-icon { font-size:25px; color:var(--red2); }
.research-number { font:10px var(--mono); color:#62626e; }
.research-card h3 { font-size:21px; margin-bottom:12px; }
.research-card p { color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; }
.tag-row { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:7px; margin-top:20px; }
.tag { padding:5px 8px; font:9px var(--mono); color:#b5b5c0; border:1px solid var(--line); }
/* RESEARCH LAB */
.lab-layout { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:18px; }
.lab-panel { border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--panel); padding:30px; }
.lab-panel h3 { font-size:24px; margin-bottom:14px; }
.lab-panel p { color:var(--muted); font-size:13px; }
.lab-list { margin-top:22px; display:grid; gap:0; }
.lab-row { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:14px; padding:17px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
.lab-row .num { color:var(--red); font:11px var(--mono); padding-top:3px; }
.lab-row strong { display:block; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:4px; }
.lab-row span { display:block; color:var(--muted); font-size:11px; }
.terminal { background:#08080b; border:1px solid var(--line); font:11px var(--mono); overflow:hidden; }
.terminal-bar { padding:12px 15px; display:flex; gap:6px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); align-items:center; }
.terminal-dot { width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; background:#4a4a54; }
.terminal-title { margin-left:auto; color:var(--muted); font-size:9px; }
.terminal-body { padding:22px; min-height:260px; color:#c5c5d0; }
.terminal-body p { font:11px/2 var(--mono); color:#c5c5d0; }
.terminal-body .prompt { color:var(--red2); }
.terminal-body .comment { color:#777783; }
.terminal-body .success { color:#83d6a5; }
.terminal-body .cursor { display:inline-block; width:7px; height:13px; background:var(--red); vertical-align:middle; animation:blink 1s steps(2) infinite; }
@keyframes blink { 50% { opacity:0; } }
/* PROJECTS */
.projects-section { background:#0a0a0f; border-block:1px solid var(--line); }
.project-filters { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:9px; margin-bottom:30px; }
.filter-btn { padding:9px 14px; border:1px solid var(--line); color:#aaaab5; background:transparent; font-size:10px; transition:.25s; }
.filter-btn.active,.filter-btn:hover { background:var(--red); border-color:var(--red); color:white; }
.projects-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:18px; }
.project-card { border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--panel); transition:.3s; overflow:hidden; }
.project-card:hover { transform:translateY(-6px); border-color:rgba(230,57,70,.5); }
.project-art { height:185px; position:relative; display:grid; place-items:center; overflow:hidden; background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%,rgba(230,57,70,.15),transparent 60%),#101016; }
.project-art::before { content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.035) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.035) 1px,transparent 1px); background-size:24px 24px; }
.art-orbit { width:115px; height:115px; border:1px solid rgba(230,57,70,.65); border-radius:50%; position:relative; animation:orbitSpin 18s linear infinite; }
.art-orbit::before { content:""; position:absolute; inset:18px -16px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35); border-radius:50%; transform:rotate(50deg); }
.art-orbit::after { content:""; position:absolute; width:13px; height:13px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--red2); top:8px; left:22px; box-shadow:0 0 20px var(--red); }
.art-core { position:absolute; width:32px; height:32px; border-radius:50%; background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,#ff9a9f,var(--red),#47101a); box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(230,57,70,.4); }
.project-card:nth-child(2) .art-orbit { border-radius:5px; transform:rotate(45deg); }
.project-card:nth-child(2) .art-orbit::before { border-radius:5px; }
.project-card:nth-child(3) .art-orbit { border-style:dashed; border-color:#c3c3ce; }
.project-card:nth-child(4) .art-core { width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:8px; }
.project-card:nth-child(5) .art-orbit { border-color:#8b8b9b; border-width:2px; }
.project-card:nth-child(6) .art-orbit { border-radius:8px; border-color:var(--red2); }
.art-index { position:absolute; top:15px; left:15px; font:9px var(--mono); color:#b2b2bf; letter-spacing:1px; }
.art-type { position:absolute; bottom:13px; right:15px; font:9px var(--mono); color:var(--red2); letter-spacing:1px; }
.project-info { padding:23px; }
.project-info h3 { font-size:19px; margin-bottom:10px; }
.project-info p { color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; min-height:60px; }
.project-footer { margin-top:18px; padding-top:15px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; }
.project-status { font:9px var(--mono); color:#c3c3cd; }
.project-status::before { content:""; display:inline-block; width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:#d1a75b; margin-right:7px; }
.project-card[hidden] { display:none; }
/* PROCESS */
.process-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:20px; }
.process-card { padding-top:22px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); position:relative; }
.process-card::before { content:""; position:absolute; top:-2px; left:0; width:35px; height:3px; background:var(--red); transition:.3s; }
.process-card:hover::before { width:100%; }
.process-num { font:11px var(--mono); color:var(--red2); margin-bottom:30px; }
.process-card h3 { font-size:19px; margin-bottom:12px; }
.process-card p { color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; }
/* PRINCIPLES */
.principles { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:45px; align-items:center; }
.principle-quote { font:500 clamp(28px,4vw,48px)/1.25 var(--heading); letter-spacing:-1.5px; }
.principle-quote span { color:var(--red2); }
.principle-list { display:grid; gap:0; }
.principle-item { padding:19px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr; gap:13px; }
.principle-item .sym { color:var(--red); font-size:16px; }
.principle-item h4 { font-size:15px; margin-bottom:5px; }
.principle-item p { color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; }
/* ROADMAP */
.roadmap-section { background:#0b0b10; border-block:1px solid var(--line); }
.roadmap { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:0; position:relative; margin-top:55px; }
.roadmap::before { content:""; position:absolute; top:7px; left:0; right:0; height:1px; background:var(--line); }
.roadmap-step { padding:34px 22px 0 0; position:relative; }
.roadmap-step::before { content:""; position:absolute; top:0; left:0; width:14px; height:14px; background:var(--bg); border:2px solid var(--red); border-radius:50%; z-index:2; }
.roadmap-step:first-child::before { background:var(--red); box-shadow:0 0 15px var(--glow); }
.roadmap-phase { font:10px var(--mono); color:var(--red2); letter-spacing:1px; margin-bottom:15px; }
.roadmap-step h3 { font-size:18px; margin-bottom:12px; }
.roadmap-step p { color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; }
/* CONTACT CTA AND FOOTER STYLES */
.cta-section {
  padding: 90px 0;
  text-align: center;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(230,57,70,.13), transparent 65%);
}
.cta-box {
  padding: 65px 25px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(230,57,70,.3);
  background: linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(230,57,70,.06),rgba(255,255,255,.01));
}
.cta-box h2 { max-width:750px; margin:0 auto 20px; }
.cta-box p { color:var(--muted); max-width:560px; margin:0 auto 28px; }
footer { padding:45px 0 25px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); background:#07070a; }
.footer-top { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; gap:35px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.footer-brand { max-width:360px; }
.footer-brand p { margin-top:15px; color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; }
.footer-links { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:22px; }
.footer-links a { color:#b5b5c0; font-size:11px; }
.footer-links a:hover { color:var(--red2); }
.footer-bottom {
  border-top:1px solid var(--line); margin-top:35px; padding-top:20px;
  display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:15px; flex-wrap:wrap;
  color:#777783; font:10px var(--mono);
}
.reveal { opacity:0; transform:translateY(25px); transition:opacity .7s,transform .7s; }
.reveal.visible { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }
.back-top {
  position:fixed; bottom:25px; right:25px; width:42px; height:42px;
  border:1px solid var(--line); background:#111117; color:white;
  z-index:80; opacity:0; visibility:hidden; transition:.3s;
}
.back-top.show { opacity:1; visibility:visible; }
.back-top:hover { background:var(--red); }
@media(max-width:950px) {
  .nav-links { gap:15px; }
  .hero-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .hero-copy { max-width:750px; }
  .universe { width:min(80%,450px); margin-top:25px; }
  .about-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:35px; }
  .about-visual { min-height:330px; }
  .research-grid,.projects-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); }
  .mission-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .process-grid,.roadmap { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:30px; }
  .roadmap::before { display:none; }
  .roadmap-step { border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:22px; }
  .roadmap-step::before { top:-7px; }
}
@media(max-width:700px) {
  .section { padding:75px 0; }
  header { height:67px; }
  .menu-toggle { display:block; }
  .nav-links {
    display:none; position:absolute; top:66px; left:0; right:0;
    padding:22px 5%; background:rgba(8,8,11,.98);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); flex-direction:column;
    align-items:stretch; gap:0;
  }
  .nav-links.open { display:flex; }
  .nav-links a { padding:13px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .nav-links .nav-cta { text-align:center; margin-top:12px; padding:12px; }
  .hero { padding:125px 0 65px; }
  .hero h1 { letter-spacing:-3px; }
  .hero-meta { gap:18px; margin-top:35px; }
  .universe { width:100%; }
  .orbit-label { font-size:8px; }
  .research-grid,.projects-grid,.lab-layout { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .process-grid,.roadmap { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .principles { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:30px; }
  .footer-top { flex-direction:column; }
  .footer-bottom { flex-direction:column; }
  .logo-wordmark img { width:125px; height:23px; }
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) {
  *,*::before,*::after {
    animation-duration:.01ms !important;
    animation-iteration-count:1 !important;
    scroll-behavior:auto !important;
    transition-duration:.01ms !important;
  }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="loader" aria-label="Loading ASTROVYN">
  <div class="loader-mark">ASTRO<span>VYN</span></div>
  <div class="loader-line"></div>
  <div class="loader-caption">INITIALIZING EXPLORATION</div>
</div>

<header id="header">
  <div class="container nav">
    <a class="logo" href="#home" aria-label="ASTROVYN home">
      <span class="logo-wordmark">
        <img src="logo.png" alt="ASTROVYN logo">
        <small>RESEARCH · INNOVATION · FUTURE</small>
      </span>
    </a>

    <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" aria-label="Open navigation" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>

    <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#research">Research</a>
      <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
      <a href="#process">Our Approach</a>
      <a href="#roadmap">Roadmap</a>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">Let's Connect ↗</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="status"><span class="status-dot"></span> INDEPENDENT RESEARCH COMMUNITY</div>
      <h1>BEYOND<br><span class="outline">WHAT</span><br><span class="red">EXISTS.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Exploring the unknown. Researching bold ideas. Building toward a future
        shaped by science, technology and human curiosity.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#about">EXPLORE ASTROVYN <span>↗</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#projects">DISCOVER OUR WORK ↓</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta">
        <div class="meta-item"><strong>RESEARCH</strong><span>Question everything</span></div>
        <div class="meta-item"><strong>INNOVATION</strong><span>Build new possibilities</span></div>
        <div class="meta-item"><strong>EXPLORATION</strong><span>Go beyond the known</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="universe" aria-label="Animated planetary illustration">
      <div class="orbit one"></div>
      <div class="orbit two"></div>
      <div class="orbit three"></div>
      <div class="planet"></div>
      <div class="satellite"></div>
      <span class="star s1"></span><span class="star s2"></span>
      <span class="star s3"></span><span class="star s4"></span>
      <span class="orbit-label l1">UNKNOWN / 001</span>
      <span class="orbit-label l2">EXPLORE THE IMPOSSIBLE</span>
      <span class="orbit-label l3">FUTURE IN PROGRESS</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="marquee" aria-label="ASTROVYN focus areas">
  <div class="marquee-track">
    <div class="marquee-item"><span>✳</span>SPACE SCIENCE</div>
    <div class="marquee-item"><span>✳</span>ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE</div>
    <div class="marquee-item"><span>✳</span>ROBOTICS</div>
    <div class="marquee-item"><span>✳</span>FUTURE TECHNOLOGY</div>
    <div class="marquee-item"><span>✳</span>ASTROPHYSICS</div>
    <div class="marquee-item"><span>✳</span>ENGINEERING</div>
    <div class="marquee-item"><span>✳</span>SPACE SCIENCE</div>
    <div class="marquee-item"><span>✳</span>ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE</div>
    <div class="marquee-item"><span>✳</span>ROBOTICS</div>
    <div class="marquee-item"><span>✳</span>FUTURE TECHNOLOGY</div>
    <div class="marquee-item"><span>✳</span>ASTROPHYSICS</div>
    <div class="marquee-item"><span>✳</span>ENGINEERING</div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="container about-grid">
    <div class="about-visual reveal">
      <span class="visual-corner tl">FIG. 001 — OUR IDENTITY</span>
      <div class="about-symbol">A</div>
      <span class="visual-corner br">CURIOSITY → INNOVATION</span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-content reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">01 / WHO WE ARE</div>
      <h2>A COMMUNITY BUILT FOR THE <span class="accent">CURIOUS.</span></h2>
      <h3 style="margin-top:25px">What is ASTROVYN?</h3>
      <p>
        ASTROVYN is an independent research and innovation community created
        around one powerful idea: curiosity should lead somewhere.
      </p>
      <p>
        We explore questions across space science, artificial intelligence,
        robotics and emerging technologies. We study concepts, develop ideas,
        investigate possibilities and work toward projects that turn learning
        into something meaningful.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our goal is to make complex ideas easier to explore, encourage
        independent thinking and share our journey with people who want to
        understand how the world—and the universe—works.
      </p>
      <div class="about-highlight">
        “Converting curiosity into innovations.”
      </div>
      <a href="#research" class="text-link">EXPLORE OUR FIELDS <span>→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section mission-section" id="mission">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">02 / OUR PURPOSE</div>
      <h2>THINK DEEPER.<br><span class="accent">BUILD FURTHER.</span></h2>
      <p>Our work is guided by three connected principles: understanding the
      world, developing ideas and sharing what we discover.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mission-grid">
      <article class="mission-card reveal">
        <div class="card-index">01 — DISCOVER</div>
        <div class="mission-icon">◎</div>
        <h3>Explore Questions</h3>
        <p>Investigate scientific concepts, ask better questions and learn
        about the systems that shape our universe and technology.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="mission-card reveal">
        <div class="card-index">02 — DEVELOP</div>
        <div class="mission-icon">⌘</div>
        <h3>Build Ideas</h3>
        <p>Move beyond theory through design, experimentation, research and
        practical projects that help ideas take shape.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="mission-card reveal">
        <div class="card-index">03 — SHARE</div>
        <div class="mission-icon">↗</div>
        <h3>Grow Together</h3>
        <p>Document our learning, communicate discoveries and encourage a
        community where thoughtful questions are always welcome.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="research">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">03 / RESEARCH DOMAINS</div>
      <h2>THE FRONTIERS<br>WE <span class="accent">EXPLORE.</span></h2>
      <p>Science and technology are interconnected. These are the fields that
      inspire our research, learning and future project ideas.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="research-grid">
      <article class="research-card reveal">
        <div class="research-top"><span class="research-icon">✦</span><span class="research-number">FIELD / 01</span></div>
        <h3>Space Science</h3>
        <p>Explore planets, stars, galaxies, orbital mechanics and the
        scientific questions that shape our understanding of the universe.</p>
        <div class="tag-row"><span class="tag">ASTRONOMY</span><span class="tag">COSMOLOGY</span></div>
      </article>
      <article class="research-card reveal">
        <div class="research-top"><span class="research-icon">⌘</span><span class="research-number">FIELD / 02</span></div>
        <h3>Artificial Intelligence</h3>
        <p>Study machine learning, intelligent systems and how AI can help
        people analyze information and solve challenging problems.</p>
        <div class="tag-row"><span class="tag">MACHINE LEARNING</span><span class="tag">AI SYSTEMS</span></div>
      </article>
      <article class="research-card reveal">
        <div class="research-top"><span class="research-icon">◇</span><span class="research-number">FIELD / 03</span></div>
        <h3>Robotics</h3>
        <p>Investigate the relationship between sensors, control systems,
        mechanical design and intelligent machines.</p>
        <div class="tag-row"><span class="tag">AUTOMATION</span><span class="tag">CONTROL</span></div>
      </article>
      <article class="research-card reveal">
        <div class="research-top"><span class="research-icon">⌁</span><span class="research-number">FIELD / 04</span></div>
        <h3>Propulsion & Spaceflight</h3>
        <p>Understand the physics of rockets, spacecraft motion, propulsion
        concepts and the engineering challenges of space exploration.</p>
        <div class="tag-row"><span class="tag">ROCKET SCIENCE</span><span class="tag">AEROSPACE</span></div>
      </article>
      <article class="research-card reveal">
        <div class="research-top"><span class="research-icon">∿</span><span class="research-number">FIELD / 05</span></div>
        <h3>Quantum Physics</h3>
        <p>Explore the fundamental ideas behind quantum mechanics and the
        scientific principles that may shape future technologies.</p>
        <div class="tag-row"><span class="tag">PHYSICS</span><span class="tag">QUANTUM THEORY</span></div>
      </article>
      <article class="research-card reveal">
        <div class="research-top"><span class="research-icon">⌬</span><span class="research-number">FIELD / 06</span></div>
        <h3>Emerging Technology</h3>
        <p>Study new ideas in computing, energy, materials and engineering
        to understand how technology could evolve.</p>
        <div class="tag-row"><span class="tag">INNOVATION</span><span class="tag">ENGINEERING</span></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section mission-section" id="lab">
  <div class="container lab-layout">
    <div class="lab-panel reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">04 / HOW WE WORK</div>
      <h3>Research starts with a question.</h3>
      <p>We approach learning as an ongoing process: identify a question,
      study what is already known, form an idea and explore how it might be tested.</p>
      <div class="lab-list">
        <div class="lab-row"><span class="num">01</span><div><strong>Question</strong><span>Define the problem and what we want to understand.</span></div></div>
        <div class="lab-row"><span class="num">02</span><div><strong>Investigate</strong><span>Read, compare sources and build a solid foundation.</span></div></div>
        <div class="lab-row"><span class="num">03</span><div><strong>Develop</strong><span>Design a concept, model, simulation or research plan.</span></div></div>
        <div class="lab-row"><span class="num">04</span><div><strong>Document</strong><span>Record results, limitations, lessons and next questions.</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-panel reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">RESEARCH CONSOLE / 001</div>
      <div class="terminal">
        <div class="terminal-bar">
          <span class="terminal-dot"></span><span class="terminal-dot"></span><span class="terminal-dot"></span>
          <span class="terminal-title">astrovyn.research</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-body">
          <p><span class="prompt">astrovyn@research:~$</span> initialize curiosity</p>
          <p class="comment"># Every discovery begins with a question.</p>
          <p><span class="prompt">astrovyn@research:~$</span> explore --domain=universe</p>
          <p class="success">[OK] Scientific curiosity initialized.</p>
          <p class="success">[OK] Research pathways identified.</p>
          <p><span class="prompt">astrovyn@research:~$</span> develop --mode=innovation</p>
          <p class="success">[RUNNING] Ideas becoming possibilities...</p>
          <p><span class="prompt">astrovyn@research:~$</span> <span class="cursor"></span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:20px">A mindset, not a finish line. Each project creates new questions,
      new lessons and new opportunities to improve.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section projects-section" id="projects">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">05 / PROJECT EXPLORER</div>
      <h2>IDEAS IN<br><span class="accent">DEVELOPMENT.</span></h2>
      <p>A look at the types of projects and research concepts we want to
      investigate. These are exploration areas, not claims of completed work.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="project-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter project concepts">
      <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="all">ALL CONCEPTS</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="space">SPACE</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="ai">AI & ROBOTICS</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="physics">PHYSICS</button>
    </div>
    <div class="projects-grid">
      <article class="project-card reveal" data-category="space">
        <div class="project-art"><span class="art-index">CONCEPT / 001</span><div class="art-orbit"></div><div class="art-core"></div><span class="art-type">SPACE SCIENCE</span></div>
        <div class="project-info">
          <h3>Orbital Mechanics Explorer</h3>
          <p>A learning concept for understanding how gravity, velocity and orbital paths shape the movement of satellites and planets.</p>
          <div class="project-footer"><span class="project-status">CONCEPT STAGE</span><span class="small-label">01 / 06</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="project-card reveal" data-category="ai">
        <div class="project-art"><span class="art-index">CONCEPT / 002</span><div class="art-orbit"></div><div class="art-core"></div><span class="art-type">ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE</span></div>
        <div class="project-info">
          <h3>Intelligent Systems Lab</h3>
          <p>An exploration of how data, algorithms and decision systems can be used to build useful AI-powered learning tools.</p>
          <div class="project-footer"><span class="project-status">CONCEPT STAGE</span><span class="small-label">02 / 06</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="project-card reveal" data-category="physics">
        <div class="project-art"><span class="art-index">CONCEPT / 003</span><div class="art-orbit"></div><div class="art-core"></div><span class="art-type">PHYSICS</span></div>
        <div class="project-info">
          <h3>Energy & the Universe</h3>
          <p>A research topic exploring energy, stars, radiation and the physical processes that power the cosmos.</p>
          <div class="project-footer"><span class="project-status">CONCEPT STAGE</span><span class="small-label">03 / 06</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="project-card reveal" data-category="ai">
        <div class="project-art"><span class="art-index">CONCEPT / 004</span><div class="art-orbit"></div><div class="art-core"></div><span class="art-type">ROBOTICS</span></div>
        <div class="project-info">
          <h3>Autonomous Robotics</h3>
          <p>A learning pathway for investigating sensors, motion planning, feedback and the foundations of autonomous machines.</p>
          <div class="project-footer"><span class="project-status">CONCEPT STAGE</span><span class="small-label">04 / 06</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="project-card reveal" data-category="space">
        <div class="project-art"><span class="art-index">CONCEPT / 005</span><div class="art-orbit"></div><div class="art-core"></div><span class="art-type">AEROSPACE</span></div>
        <div class="project-info">
          <h3>Spaceflight Fundamentals</h3>
          <p>A study of launch systems, spacecraft design principles and the physics that makes space missions possible.</p>
          <div class="project-footer"><span class="project-status">CONCEPT STAGE</span><span class="small-label">05 / 06</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="project-card reveal" data-category="physics">
        <div class="project-art"><span class="art-index">CONCEPT / 006</span><div class="art-orbit"></div><div class="art-core"></div><span class="art-type">FUTURE TECHNOLOGY</span></div>
        <div class="project-info">
          <h3>Future Technology Watch</h3>
          <p>A structured exploration of emerging scientific ideas, their evidence, practical challenges and potential applications.</p>
          <div class="project-footer"><span class="project-status">CONCEPT STAGE</span><span class="small-label">06 / 06</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="process">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">06 / OUR APPROACH</div>
      <h2>FROM CURIOSITY<br>TO <span class="accent">CLARITY.</span></h2>
      <p>Meaningful innovation takes time. We value a clear process, honest
      documentation and the willingness to learn from what does not work.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="process-grid">
      <article class="process-card reveal"><div class="process-num">STEP 01</div><h3>Observe</h3><p>Notice a problem, an unanswered question or an idea worth exploring.</p></article>
      <article class="process-card reveal"><div class="process-num">STEP 02</div><h3>Understand</h3><p>Study the science, evidence, existing work and constraints around it.</p></article>
      <article class="process-card reveal"><div class="process-num">STEP 03</div><h3>Experiment</h3><p>Test ideas through safe models, simulations, analysis or prototypes.</p></article>
      <article class="process-card reveal"><div class="process-num">STEP 04</div><h3>Improve</h3><p>Evaluate what happened, document the outcome and identify the next step.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section mission-section" id="principles">
  <div class="container principles">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">07 / WHAT WE BELIEVE</div>
      <div class="principle-quote">“The future belongs to those who dare to <span>ask why.</span>”</div>
    </div>
    <div class="principle-list reveal">
      <div class="principle-item"><div class="sym">✳</div><div><h4>Curiosity Comes First</h4><p>Every question is an opportunity to learn something new.</p></div></div>
      <div class="principle-item"><div class="sym">◎</div><div><h4>Evidence Matters</h4><p>We aim to distinguish established science, hypotheses and speculation.</p></div></div>
      <div class="principle-item"><div class="sym">◇</div><div><h4>Progress Through Practice</h4><p>Skills grow through consistent study, thoughtful experimentation and reflection.</p></div></div>
      <div class="principle-item"><div class="sym">↗</div><div><h4>Knowledge Is Meant to Be Shared</h4><p>Clear communication helps others learn and build on what came before.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section roadmap-section" id="roadmap">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">08 / THE ROAD AHEAD</div>
      <h2>BUILT STEP<br>BY <span class="accent">STEP.</span></h2>
      <p>ASTROVYN is a work in progress. Our roadmap reflects a direction
      for growth, not a claim that every milestone has already been achieved.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="roadmap">
      <article class="roadmap-step reveal"><div class="roadmap-phase">PHASE / 01</div><h3>Build Foundations</h3><p>Develop knowledge, organize research topics and create a consistent learning process.</p></article>
      <article class="roadmap-step reveal"><div class="roadmap-phase">PHASE / 02</div><h3>Explore Concepts</h3><p>Turn questions into research notes, models, simulations and project plans.</p></article>
      <article class="roadmap-step reveal"><div class="roadmap-phase">PHASE / 03</div><h3>Share Progress</h3><p>Publish project updates, explain discoveries and make learning accessible.</p></article>
      <article class="roadmap-step reveal"><div class="roadmap-phase">PHASE / 04</div><h3>Grow the Community</h3><p>Connect with curious learners and collaborate on meaningful ideas.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="founder">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">09 / THE PERSON BEHIND THE VISION</div>
      <h2>ONE CURIOSITY.<br><span class="accent">ENDLESS POSSIBILITIES.</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-visual reveal">
        <span class="visual-corner tl">ASTROVYN / FOUNDER</span>
        <img src="logo.png" alt="ASTROVYN official logo"
             style="width:88%;height:auto;object-fit:contain;position:relative;z-index:2">
        <span class="visual-corner br">BUILDING THE FUTURE</span>
      </div>

      <div class="about-content reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow">FOUNDER & COMMUNITY BUILDER</div>
        <h3>ANSH SRIVASTAVA</h3>
        <p>
          I am a Class 11 student and JEE aspirant with a strong interest in
          science, space exploration, artificial intelligence and emerging
          technologies.
        </p>
        <p>
          ASTROVYN is my initiative to explore scientific questions, research
          new ideas, work on projects and share the learning journey with the
          world. I believe that meaningful progress begins with curiosity,
          consistent effort and the courage to explore unfamiliar ideas.
        </p>
        <div class="about-highlight">
          My vision is to keep learning, turn ideas into projects and build a
          community that inspires scientific curiosity and innovation.
        </div>
        <div class="tag-row">
          <span class="tag">STUDENT</span>
          <span class="tag">JEE ASPIRANT</span>
          <span class="tag">FOUNDER</span>
          <span class="tag">RESEARCH & INNOVATION</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-section" id="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-box reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">10 / LET'S CONNECT</div>
      <h2>HAVE AN IDEA?<br><span class="accent">LET'S EXPLORE IT.</span></h2>
      <p>
        Interested in science, technology, research or creative ideas?
